PR #486 is open, taking `ci-models-override` into `main`: https://github.com/dogkeeper886/ollama37/pull/486. It isn't tied to any issue, so merging it won't close anything (checked on GitHub). Since there's no issue, no review label was set.

To test it, run `docker compose config` from `docker/` three ways:
- with both variables set: the bind mount appears over `/root/.ollama/models`;
